They appear below through their effect \[LongDash] the basis rotations show \
up in the emitted instruction list, ",
 Cell[BoxData["oddParityRate"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3e367b18-9aa8-58f9-67ce-73421f5d2ac3"],
