}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The distance is worth a pause: it is ",
 StyleBox["1",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ", not 3. The classical repetition code corrects three bit flips, but as a \
quantum code a lone ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["Z", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4ebf3687-f906-130d-7644-afe0f8b37e57"],
 " commutes with both checks and is not in the stabilizer group, so it is an \
undetectable weight-one logical. The layer reports the mathematics, not the \
folklore."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"65de4a87-3471-cd9f-13e6-63e1bd0597e5"],

Cell["Circuit.wl \[LongDash] the syndrome-extraction circuit", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"7bedd9bd-1d84-ddaa-2992-d0e79436a7f0"],

Cell["\<\
Up to here a check was measured by fiat. That is the right object at \
code-capacity level, where measurement is assumed perfect. It is also the \
thing that has to go if the noise is going to be honest, because in a real \
device a check is not a matrix product \[LongDash] it is a subcircuit, and \
every gate and every readout in it can fail.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4c37f35a-e1a6-07fe-75cc-eb0790536dc4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The construction is one ancilla per generator, which is Gottesman's section \
12.1.1, figure 12.1a \[LongDash] a section titled ",
 StyleBox["Non-Fault-Tolerant Measurement of Paulis", "TI"],
 ", which is the honest name for what this is."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"02f88238-86c8-66df-3287-2462337d4c25"],

Cell["One generator, by hand", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"034d641c-5834-e412-3173-7e4659c6cf78"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "An instruction is a plain list ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{"op", ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"qubits", "..."}]}], "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "52ce4f6a-032d-a48b-02f6-6734b6d90ed1"],
 ", deliberately without a head: the frame propagator walks millions of them \
and a ",
 Cell[BoxData["Switch"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5bfe104a-50de-a555-0985-8a1461680fbf"],
 " on a string part is the cheapest dispatch available. The one-qubit \
vocabulary:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"134534fb-1061-d656-417a-ada5a115bcbc"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData["oneQubitOps"], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[5]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"2cd98fd2-34e7-e188-54e6-269cbc93b3d2"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"\<\"H\"\>", ",", "\<\"S\"\>", ",", "\<\"V\"\>", 
   ",", "\<\"Vdg\"\>"}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[5]= ",ExpressionUUID->"6e1c99a5-dcef-9c28-1623-100ed49be772"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Take the five-qubit code's first generator. To measure a Pauli ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["g", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "608e87cc-8fce-afdf-10b5-1e962a78f525"],
 ", rotate each data qubit in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["g", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2aa912c6-4938-1bb7-5a56-8ba068cd699d"],
 "'s support so that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["g", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "66b4bee0-d247-b105-0e4b-37cde7f3006f"],
 "'s letter there becomes ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["Z", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "337c2d89-644e-5b5e-6103-c4d30dfb29a4"],
 ", CNOT each of those into the ancilla, rotate back, and measure the ancilla \
in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   StyleBox["Z", "TI"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5f7c2741-1c81-ec9b-0503-bf2b9535b6e1"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"644cc522-c7c4-9b18-0c73-dc8ff276e662"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["X", "TI"], "\[Rule]", 
    StyleBox["H", "TI"], "  ", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["H", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["X", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["H", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
      StyleBox["Z", "TI"]}], ")"}], 
    RowBox[{",", "    "}], 
    StyleBox["Y", "TI"], "\[Rule]", 
    StyleBox["V", "TI"], "  ", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["Y", "TI"], 
      SuperscriptBox[
       StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
       RowBox[{"-", "1"}]], "\[LongEqual]", 
      StyleBox["Z", "TI"]}], ")"}], 
    RowBox[{",", "    "}], 
    StyleBox["Z", "TI"], "\[Rule]", "nothing"}],
   TraditionalForm],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",ExpressionUUID->"2de8c8f9-eaf3-8e90-5b97-e1a28e87d4fa"],

