Cell["The Pauli frame", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"36c19c85-764d-0b01-5efe-15ef03f8566b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Here is the move that makes everything downstream viable. The circuit is \
Clifford and the noise is Pauli, so a fault does not have to be simulated as \
a state \[LongDash] it can be carried as a Pauli ",
 StyleBox["frame", "TI"],
 " and pushed through the gates by conjugation, which over GF(2) is four XORs:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6815cd54-0cd7-196f-182a-e51ea5626bb5"],

