}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Data qubit 1 is touched exactly once, by the CNOT at instruction 2 in layer \
2. So it is idle in layers 1, 3, 4, 5 and 6, anchored before the circuit for \
the first and after that one instruction for the other four. Several layers \
sharing an anchor is correct rather than a collapse: they are independent \
chances to decohere during a wait the propagator sees as a single gap.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"74397683-04f4-1d4d-1dc7-6fedac816797"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData["circuitIdleSlots"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "735e49d5-32a1-4a48-2166-609f47541892"],
 " is the single source of truth, and it is shared on purpose \[LongDash] the \
detector model turns each slot into a mechanism and the Stim writer turns \
each slot into a ",
 Cell[BoxData["DEPOLARIZE1"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "335d55a2-cf9b-493d-6163-4c0fea2e1807"],
 " at the same anchor, so the exported circuit cannot drift from the model it \
exists to cross-check:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3bfbbd45-edb8-1b0b-6998-352e844d6651"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Length", "[", 
  RowBox[{"circuitIdleSlots", "[", 
