Cell["Noise.wl \[LongDash] the three levels", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"0c02104f-9807-e6c4-3431-8a2919b3cc2e"],

Cell["\<\
A code means nothing until you say what it is protecting against. Three \
levels, each dropping an assumption the one before it made:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6f909018-5ea1-6a32-15af-0a425b543918"],

