  FormBox["\[Cross]", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "166277e1-e8de-815f-3e12-6eca8968d3a5"],
 " (state space), not ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["2", 
    RowBox[{"#", "faults"}]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0ae7a534-7379-468c-3a9c-3d7e060c2cd6"],
 ", and with symbolic rates the answer is a circuit-level logical error rate \
in closed form:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"34baef30-7963-b757-5c59-077a78171dbd"],

